# Sport (small view) background from the owner's manual's "Sport view (TTS)" figure (1021 x 507).
# The big rev counter (centre 509,302, radius about 162 there) goes on the car's (791,288), radius
# 290: scale 1.8125. The status rows and bottom-bar items are cut between the manual's numbered
# markers and moved to where the car shows them. Save the figure as skins/sport.png.
image sport.png
# the figure's bars and panels sit on dark grey: pull it to black
black 34
# marker 2's line over the top ticks: copy the ticks one step to the left over it
patch 503 134 11 38 -8 0
#      src x y w h          dest x y w h          shape feather
layer  347 140 324 324      497 -6 587 587        circle 8
layer  182 136 160 28       198 24 290 51         rect 10
layer  652 135 200 30       1050 8 362 54         rect 10
layer  735 212 145 158      1201 125 263 286      rect 14
layer  168 417 100 30       173 486 181 54        rect 10
layer  378 417 262 30       554 486 475 54        rect 10
layer  747 419 118 28       1222 487 214 51       rect 10
